  "id": "color-harmony",
  "term": "color harmony",
  "definition": "Color harmony is the experience of a color combination as pleasing or aesthetically positive, in contrast to color disharmony, which tends to evoke unpleasant reactions. In this source, it refers to how paired colors are judged for pleasantness and esthetic value during perception.",
